# AGENTS.md overlay example

Copy into the product repo root and fill the brackets. Keep it short; shared rules live in the kit.

- This repo owns [service/boundary]. See [contract doc path].
- Agent toolkit: pinned at [tag] in `.agent-kit-version`. Install with `[kit-checkout]/install.sh --repo .`.
- Skills: load from the kit via root skill routing. Repo-specific notes: [one or two lines].
- Verification: [the repo's test gate, e.g. `make pre-push` equivalent or `go test ./...`].
